{%- comment -%}
  Laura's Story — content lives in the theme so it deploys through git.
  First-person founder narrative; supersedes the third-person page body.
{%- endcomment -%}

<section class="lm-founder">
  <div class="lm-founder__inner">

    <header class="lm-founder__hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">The Founder</p>
      <h1 class="lm-founder__title">{{ page.title | default: "Laura's Story" }}</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="lm-founder__layout">
      <figure class="lm-founder__portrait">
        <img
          src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1727/2565/files/laura-milman-portrait.jpg?v=1785208693"
          alt="Laura Milman, founder of Laura Milman New York"
          width="1176"
          height="1108"
          loading="lazy"
        >
      </figure>

      <div class="lm-founder__story">
        <p>I came to America in my twenties, from the former USSR, because my family wanted a better life. I arrived with almost nothing and did what immigrants do — I worked.</p>
        <p>I trained as a nurse. My husband and I raised our family. But the thing I had always wanted to be was an artist, and that doesn't leave you. After the long shifts, when the house was finally quiet, I would sit at the kitchen table and draw. The drawings kept turning into jewelry.</p>
        <p>My first years in the trade were spent working alongside my brother Jacob at Diamond Quasar — the house the world now knows as Jacob &amp; Co. I learned New York's Diamond District the only way you really can: from the inside, stone by stone, bench by bench.</p>
        <p>And then I did the thing that women like me were not expected to do in that industry, in those years. I opened my own company. Coming from where I came from, a woman running her own business was the whole American dream in one sentence.</p>
        <blockquote class="lm-founder__quote">
          &ldquo;What I hold most closely is that I get to help my clients create precious memories. Thirty years later, I&rsquo;m still greeting old and new clients in midtown Manhattan, in the heart of the city.&rdquo;
          <cite>&mdash; Laura</cite>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="lm-founder__cta">
      <a href="/collections/all" class="btn btn--gold">Shop the Collection</a>
      <a href="/pages/private-clients" class="btn btn--outline">Book a Consultation</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .lm-founder {
    background: var(--warm-white, #FDFAF6);
    padding: var(--space-3xl, 4rem) 0 var(--space-4xl, 6rem);
    min-height: 60vh;
  }

  .lm-founder__inner {
    max-width: var(--container-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--container-padding);
  }

  .lm-founder__hero {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3xl, 4rem);
  }

  .lm-founder__title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
  }

  .lm-founder__layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(280px, 420px) 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-3xl, 4rem);
    align-items: start;
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .lm-founder__portrait {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .lm-founder__portrait img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md, 8px);
    background: var(--cream, #FAF6F0);
  }

  .lm-founder__story p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }

  .lm-founder__quote {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--gold, #C9A050);
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .lm-founder__quote cite {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-style: normal;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold-dark, #A88340);
  }

  .lm-founder__cta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: var(--space-3xl, 4rem);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .lm-founder__layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-xl, 2rem);
    }

    .lm-founder__portrait {
      max-width: 360px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .lm-founder__hero {
      margin-bottom: var(--space-xl, 2rem);
    }
  }
</style>
